# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo ships the CATALOG, not the art.
#
# The actual asset binaries (~1.5 GB, 145k files) live only on
# local machines. This repo carries the machine-readable index
# so any Claude session can know exactly what art exists, where
# it lives, and what it looks like — without cloning a gigabyte.
#
# To rehydrate the art locally, see README.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Kenney bundle — CC0, but 1.03 GB / 90,789 files. Not pushed.
kenney/

# Original installer + bundle archives (~800 MB). Not pushed.
_source-zips/

# LimeZu "Modern Interiors" — PAID asset. Its licence explicitly
# forbids redistribution ("YOU CAN'T: Resell or distribute the
# asset to others"). Metadata is catalogued; art must never be
# committed here. These rules are a hard safety net.
modern-interiors/
limezu/
**/moderninteriors-win/
**/Modern_Interiors_RPG_Maker_Version/
**/Modern_Interiors_Free_v2.2/

# Sliced output is regenerable from the source sheets — not pushed.
sliced/

# ── Belt-and-braces: no raw media of any kind outside catalog/previews ──
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.exe
*.AppImage
*.fbx
*.obj
*.mtl
*.glb
*.gltf
*.stl
*.dae
*.blend
*.ogg
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.psd
*.ai
*.eps
*.swf
*.pdf

# Images are allowed ONLY under catalog/previews/ (CC0 Kenney previews).
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.svg
!catalog/previews/**/*.png

# ── OS / editor metadata ──
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# ── Claude session state ──
.claude/
scratchpad/
*.tmp
*.log
